            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The quotient rule with numerator derivative 2sin x and denominator derivative cos x gives f'(x) = (2sin x sin x - (3 - 2cos x)cos x)/sin^2 x.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Subtract",
