               ],
               2
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "Collect 2sin^2 x + 2cos^2 x = 2 by the Pythagorean identity, so f'(x) = (2 - 3cos x)/sin^2 x.",
         "mathjson": [
            "Divide",
            [
               "Subtract",
